# warehouse.duckdb and rag/vectorstore/ are intentionally NOT ignored: they're
# committed as a prebuilt demo snapshot so Streamlit Community Cloud (which
# only runs `pip install`, not the dbt/RAG pipeline) has data to serve
# immediately. The generator is seeded, but several date fields are relative
# to "today" at generation time, so re-running scripts/run_pipeline.sh
# produces very similar but not byte-identical data. If you'd rather keep
# these out of git for local-only development, re-add:
#   warehouse.duckdb
#   rag/vectorstore/
